      "day": 1,
      "title": "Arrival & Mountain Air",
      "narrative": "Touch down in Darjeeling and feel the cool hill breeze. Check in and step out for a relaxed walk through the town’s gentle streets, taking in the everyday life of this highland retreat. As the day winds down, settle in for a view of the distant peaks bathed in golden light."
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "title": "Tea Country & Valley Views",
      "narrative": "Spend the day among Darjeeling’s renowned tea gardens. Stroll through orderly rows of tea bushes, learn about traditional processing, and enjoy panoramic stretches of misty valleys and snow-capped horizons. The experience offers a peaceful connection to the land and its centuries-old craft."
    },
    {
      "day": 3,
      "title": "Farewell & Highland Goodbye",
      "narrative": "Enjoy a final morning in the hills, watching the sunrise paint the landscape. Before departing, sample local flavors or browse a small workshop for a last keepsake. Leave Darjeeling with the scent of tea smoke and the memory of its tranquil, elevated charm."
    }
  ]
}
